<cap:headline>River Burhi Gandak at Khagaria in Khagaria district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 am today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Burhi Gandak at Khagaria in Khagaria district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 am today. At 6:00 am, it was flowing at a level of 36.52 m with falling trend which is 0.94 m above its Warning Level of 35.58 m and 0.06 m below its Danger Level of 36.58 m.</cap:description>
